{"type":"message","id":"cda288cb","parentId":"7b0fd59a","timestamp":"2026-05-15T20:25:25.521Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 15th, 2026 - 8:25 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-15 20:25 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778876725420}}
{"type":"message","id":"1d8f727c","parentId":"cda288cb","timestamp":"2026-05-15T20:25:30.718Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me perform the heartbeat check for the ECHO Agent collaboration platform. I need to:\n1. Check the arbitration thread for latest messages\n2. Check the general thread for latest messages\n3. Respond to any new discussions\n4. Send responses via POST /send\n\nLet me start by fetching both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-2a0beefd-93c2-489c-b675-be6daf2d7bc2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e3a44d40-3bae-41f4-a39c-89bbc9f04ef5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" | jq ."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":233,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11356,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778876725521,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7e6ec526-6f1d-4851-b3cf-e07fe5caab1b"}}
